<title>BELGIUM: Coceral details EU 1997 grain crop forecast.</title>
<headline>Coceral details EU 1997 grain crop forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union grain crop in the 15 member states is forecast falling to 197.29 million tonnes in 1997 from 201.54 million in 1996, Coceral, the EU grain trade association, said on Friday.</p>
<p>The forecast for each cereal was (million tonnes)-</p>
<p>			 1997	 1996	 pct change</p>
<p>							97/96</p>
<p> Total Grain	 197.289    201.540     -2.2</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p> Soft Wheat	   88.426     90.575     -2.4</p>
<p> Durum wheat	   6.771	7.191     -5.8</p>
<p> Barley		 50.845     51.843     -1.9</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Spring barley	23.701     24.300     -2.5</p>
<p> Maize		  33.370     33.921     -1.6</p>
<p> Rye		     5.639	5.848     -3.6</p>
<p> Oats		    7.137	7.564     -5.6</p>
<p> Sorghum		   728	  711     +2.4</p>
<p> Triticale	     4.373	3.888    +12.5</p>
<p>The forecast area for each cereal was (million ha)-</p>
<p>			1997    pvs 1997   1996    pct change</p>
<p>				  forecast	     96/95</p>
<p> Total Area	 37.364  37.649     36.363  +2.8</p>
<p> Soft wheat	 14.040  14.064     13.785  +1.9</p>
<p> Durum wheat	 2.963   3.224	2.836  +4.5</p>
<p> Barley	     11.773  11.785     11.340  +3.8</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Spring Barley     6.204   7.799	5.981  +3.7</p>
<p> Maize		 4.145   4.162	4.061  +2.1</p>
<p> Rye		   1.352   1.358	1.347  +0.4</p>
<p> Oats		  2.097   2.059	2.123  -1.2</p>
<p> Sorghum	     0.126     -	  0.117  +7.8</p>
<p> Triticale	   0.868     -	  0.754 +15.0</p>
<p>The forecast yield for each cereal was (tonnes per ha)-</p>
<p>			 1997    pvs 1997   1996   pct change</p>
<p>				   forecast		97/96</p>
<p> All cereals	 5.28     -	   5.54	-4.7</p>
<p> Soft Wheat	  6.30     -	   6.57	-4.1</p>
<p> Durum Wheat	 2.28     -	   2.54	-9.9</p>
<p> Barley		4.32     -	   4.57	-5.5</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Spring barley     3.82     -	   4.06	-6.0</p>
<p> Maize		 8.05     -	   8.35	-3.6</p>
<p> Rye		   4.17     -	   4.34	-3.9</p>
<p> Oats		  3.40     -	   3.56	-4.5</p>
<p> Sorghum	     5.79     -	   6.10	-5.0</p>
<p> Triticale	   5.04		   5.19	-2.9</p>
</text>
